stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
50 750 Td
(Common Medication Errors at Home) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The most frequent mistakes reported by pharmacists:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Taking two products that contain the same active ingredient,) Tj
T*
(  for example a cold medicine plus a pain reliever, causing overdose.) Tj
T*
(- Continuing an antibiotic after symptoms improve, which promotes resistance.) Tj
T*
(- Using an expired liquid medicine without checking for cloudiness) Tj
T*
(  or sediment.) Tj
T*
(- Sharing prescription medicine with family members.) Tj
T*
(- Splitting a sustained release tablet, which releases the whole dose at once.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Prevention is simple: read the label every time, keep a written list of) Tj
T*
(current medicines, and ask a pharmacist when two products overlap.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
